comments.body:
@tzachi-dar interesting you point this out (about dual high alarms for different purposes). I woke up in the middle of the night - to yet another alarm. And I wondered why it was my second (actual) low alarm, and why my warning sonar ping hadn't woken me since I sat in the semi low zone for quite a few minutes.

Now I'd either slept through the softer alarm or perhaps having two alarms quite close together causes some inability for the lower one to adhere to the snoozing first.

I guess I need to test that theory somehow. But I wasn't about to investigate size 6 font at 4 in the morning.
